NOTES
- Raw-Tr passthrough verified empirically on this build: `3 Tr` in the F03
  invisible layer reads back as raw 3 (pypdfium2 enum NAME for 3 is
  FILL_STROKE, INVISIBLE is 4). The adapter interprets content-stream Tr
  semantics and records raw+name on every observation; the Tr 0..7 sweep
  test pins the mapping.
- F04/F05/F06 fixture families are catalog 'specified' on this base; their
  criteria are covered via committed fixtures (F03, F02, F07) plus
  hand-assembled in-memory minimal PDFs. Committed families remain a
  fixture-lane dependency request.
- No OCR/render/model use; single-threaded PDFium calls; no Beads writes.
